1
00:00:05,766 --> 00:00:09,500
Choo-choo, little train! In line, in line.

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:14,300
Waiting my turn, feeling fine.

3
00:00:17,066 --> 00:00:19,766
The big slide is tall and fun.

4
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:23,900
Lots of friends, not just one.

5
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,766
No need to push, no need to race.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,300
Everyone has a happy place.

7
00:00:34,566 --> 00:00:37,966
One by one, in a row,

8
00:00:38,366 --> 00:00:41,966
Step by step, watch us go.

9
00:00:42,266 --> 00:00:45,766
"After you," I say with pride.

10
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,100
Patience makes a smoother slide.

11
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,000
Wash our hands with bubbly soap.

12
00:01:01,566 --> 00:01:05,066
Waiting is easy when we have hope.

13
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:08,933
Tick-tock, clock, it won't be long,

14
00:01:09,066 --> 00:01:12,800
Singing our happy waiting song.

15
00:01:14,866 --> 00:01:18,500
One by one, in a row,

16
00:01:18,666 --> 00:01:22,300
Step by step, watch us go.

17
00:01:22,566 --> 00:01:26,100
"After you," I say with pride.

18
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:29,400
Patience makes a smoother slide.

19
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:33,666
I can wait, yes, I can!

20
00:01:33,966 --> 00:01:37,666
I am patience's number one fan.

